**Important node-only imports for the Cloudflare port:**
- `node:crypto` — `createHash`, `generateKeyPairSync`, `randomBytes`, `timingSafeEqual` → use Web Crypto API (`crypto.subtle`, `crypto.getRandomValues`)
- `node:dns/promises` — DNS lookup for invite resolution probing → not available in Workers; the whole `resolveInviteResolutionTarget` / `probeInviteResolutionTarget` subsystem needs Workers-compatible replacements
- `node:fs`, `node:path`, `node:url` — for `readSkillMarkdown` / `listAvailableSkills` → must inline as constants or use KV/R2
- `node:http`, `node:https`, `node:net` — for the HTTP HEAD probe — not available in Workers; use `fetch()`

